bot join ke chatroom tertentu
{command} [conference] (1=bot's_jid) (2=bot's_nick) (3=prefix) (4=chat's_password)
*/{command} chat@conference.jab.com
bot akan join chat@conference.jab.com
*/{command} chat@conference.jab.com 4=loko-champ 3=!
bot akan join chatroom dengan password "loko-champ" dan set prefix command - "!"
*/{command} chat@conference.jab.com 1=bot@j.ru 2=Black-Bot
bot akan join chatroom dengan nick "Black-Bot" dan jid "bot@j.ru" (kalau itu JID bot)
